              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze hanyuma y’ivyo umwami Ahasuwerusi akuza Hamani mwene Hamedata, Umwagagi, amushira hejuru, intebe yiwe ayisumbisha iz’ abaganwa bose basabanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.5.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 5:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abagendanyi b’ umwami bose bāri ku kirimba i bgami bunamira Hamani, bakamwikubita imbere, kuk’ umwami yari yābishinze ngo bamuhe ico cubahiro. Ariko Moridekayi ntiyamwunamira, ntiyamwikubita imbere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abagendanyi b’ umwami bāri ku kirimba i bgami, babaza Moridekayi, bati N’iki gituma uca mu cagezwe c’umwami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bashishikara kubimubarira uko bukeye, ntiyabumvira; baca babibarira Hamani, ngo barābe ivya Moridekayi uko vyoba, kuko yari yābabariye ngo n’Umuyuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Hamani abonye yuko Moridekayi atamwunamiye canke ngw amwikubite imbere, aca arashangashirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw abona yuko gufata Moridekayi wenyene ata kimazi, kuko bari bamubgiye ubgoko bga Moridekayi ubg’ ari bgo; ni co catumye Hamani arondera uburyo bgo kugeseza Abayuda bose bāri mu bihugu vyose vy’umwami Ahasuwerusi, ari bo bgoko nyene bga Moridekayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
